### Seed Data: Add-ons

### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

# ==================== ADD-ONS ====================

### Create Add-on: Inner Tag
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Inner Tag",
  "description": "Label inside the garment",
  "type": "PHYSICAL",
  "basePrice": 1.50,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Add-on: Hangtag
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hangtag",
  "description": "Brand hangtag for garment",
  "type": "PHYSICAL",
  "basePrice": 0.75,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Add-on: Hem Tag
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hem Tag",
  "description": "Tag at the hem of garment",
  "type": "PHYSICAL",
  "basePrice": 1.00,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Add-on: Sleeve Tag
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sleeve Tag",
  "description": "Tag on sleeve",
  "type": "PHYSICAL",
  "basePrice": 0.80,
  "isActive": true
}

###

# ==================== INCLUSION RULES ====================

### Create Inclusion Rule for Inner Tag (Free if quantity >= 40)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addonId": 1,
  "ruleType": "MIN_QTY",
  "thresholdValue": 40,
  "discountPercent": 100,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Inclusion Rule for Hangtag (Free if quantity >= 50)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addonId": 2,
  "ruleType": "MIN_QTY",
  "thresholdValue": 50,
  "discountPercent": 100,
  "isActive": true
}

###

# ==================== VERIFICATION ====================

### List All Add-ons
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List All Inclusion Rules
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/rules/list
Content-Type: application/json

###
